/**
 * Distinctive Vocabulary page block.
 *
 * Two corpus-linguistics views over the `articles` subset, from one
 * precomputed bundle (`files/iwac-visualizations/keyness.json`, built by
 * `scripts/generate_keyness.py`):
 *
 *   1. Keyness — the vocabulary a country or a decade uses more than the
 *      rest of the collection does. Dunning log-likelihood as the
 *      significance test (Benjamini-Hochberg corrected), ranked by log-ratio
 *      effect size. Country / Decade facet.
 *   2. Subject bursts — the years coverage of a controlled-vocabulary
 *      subject spiked above its own base rate (Kleinberg 2-state
 *      automaton), drawn as intervals on a shared year axis.
 *
 * Distinct from Term Trends, which plots how *often* a term is used: this
 * block is about where a term stands out and when it erupted.
 *
 * @var \Laminas\View\Renderer\PhpRenderer $this
 * @var \Omeka\Api\Representation\SitePageBlockRepresentation $block
 */

